  "data": {
    "cid": "4045",
    "title": "内容拓展·三",
    "category": 1,
    "header": "",
    "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\"><strong>·内容更新</strong></span></span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"201\" alt=\"深入调查.png\" title=\"深入调查.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20260113/849fd739c1203e31ab85ff7cbf18eaa1.png\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><strong><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">【深入探索】</span></strong><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">是有别于</span><strong><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">【常规行动】</span></strong><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">的独立模式，在</span><strong><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">【常规行动】</span></strong><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">中完成游戏结局一次后即可解锁</span><strong><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">【深入探索】</span></strong><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">。</span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"214\" alt=\"示意1.png\" title=\"示意1.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20260120/6b51952d5d5cc8f4d78ca04474daee54.png\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">该模式下的探险环境会有所变化，包含</span><strong><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">&lt;春游&gt;、&lt;夏游&gt;、&lt;秋游&gt;、&lt;冬游&gt;</span></strong><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">4种条目类型。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">不同的探索条目附带独特的初始参数（目标生命值、希望、源石锭、编队人数等）及探险的探索条件，将会带来多样而有趣的探险体验。</span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"215\" alt=\"示意2.png\" title=\"示意2.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20260120/eedd045e496d4e2b3f6103ae42486c3a.png\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">选择探索条目参与探险，完成探索目标可获得一次性奖励！</span></span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"203\" alt=\"组 1569.png\" title=\"组 1569.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20260113/c7b2f9ad70d90b678db159b66449064d.png\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">完成</span><strong><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">&lt;春游&gt;</span></strong><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">中任意一个探索目标后，将会解锁</span><strong><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">&lt;夏游&gt;</span></strong><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">条目类型中的所有探索条目。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">完成</span><strong><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">&lt;夏游&gt;</span></strong><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">中任意一个探索目标后，将会解锁</span><strong><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">&lt;秋游&gt;</span></strong><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">条目类型中的所有探索条目。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">完成</span><strong><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">&lt;秋游&gt;</span></strong><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">中任意一个探索目标后，将会解锁</span><strong><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">&lt;冬游&gt;</span></strong><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">条目类型中的所有探索条目。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">*</span><strong><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">【深入探索】</span></strong><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">中可能出现的收藏品、事件等，其解锁状态与您当前</span><strong><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">【见字图册】</span></strong><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">中的解锁状态无关，也无法解锁</span><strong><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">【见字图册】</span></strong><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">或更新收藏品的拥有状态。本模式不会对</span><strong><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">【岁的界园志异蚀刻章套组】</span></strong><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">和分队解锁进度进行计数。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">*</span><strong><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">【深入探索】</span></strong><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">的所有条目将会常驻，可以随时游玩。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><strong><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">·探索条目内容前瞻</span></strong></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"204\" alt=\"浊酒澄金.png\" title=\"浊酒澄金.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20260113/05dc4cc4f97dcc7014e29af89ccb11c9.png\"/></div><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">探索条目</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">浊酒澄金</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">这葫芦里的酒结了块，便是上好的金子。只是想要取用，还得废些脑子。</span></span></span></p><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">探索目标</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">累计获得320源石锭</span></span></span></p><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">探索条件</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">初始钱盒发生变化，加入己任重、军屯垦、茧成绢、火上之灶、孜孜不倦及其他通宝</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">战场中出现的宝葫芦、铁葫芦血量大幅提升</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">初始持有收藏品金酒之杯，初始携带的源石锭数量为0</span></span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"205\" alt=\"炽吾通宝.png\" title=\"炽吾通宝.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20260113/84b0da54a451c973c20ecc46ad583c89.png\"/></div><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">探索条目</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">炽吾通宝</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">一把火烧红了通宝，也烧乱了界园。</span></span></span></p><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">探索目标</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">遭遇紧急作战4次</span></span></span></p><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">探索条件</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">初始钱盒发生变化，加入寒窗志、遇良弈、隐市忧、法与律、两江春及其他通宝</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">区域布局较为特殊，紧急作战出现的频率提升</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">是非境中不再出现筹谋节点</span></span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"324\" title=\"财如泉涌.png\" alt=\"财如泉涌.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/pic/20260202/8d507908816625de5c5f604f08f6f752.png\"/></div><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">探索条目</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">财如泉涌</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">把钱财花光，把钱眼堵上。</span></span></span></p><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">探索目标</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">累计消耗200源石锭</span></span></span></p><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">探索条件</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">初始钱盒发生变化，加入安硕鼷、烽火台、商路难行、诡意代币、触锁代币及其他通宝</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">战场中出现的宝葫芦、铁葫芦血量大幅降低</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">初始携带的源石锭数量为200</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">诡意行商出现的频率提升，战斗节点出现的频率降低</span></span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"207\" alt=\"千秋满粟.png\" title=\"千秋满粟.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20260113/3aae46ce11ecb7c2e88dbcd084334972.png\"/></div><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">探索条目</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">千秋满粟</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">若是吃好了，就来消消食吧。</span></span></span></p><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">探索目标</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">在非作战节点累计消耗24点目标生命</span></span></span></p><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">探索条件</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">初始钱盒额外携带通宝修性情、心无患</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">初始持有收藏品长生者之证</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">是非境中不再出现祸乱节点</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">界园的结构已发生变化，请小心应对</span></span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"208\" alt=\"花开富贵.png\" title=\"花开富贵.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20260113/17ddeadfa9e3edea5ae7234a4c5d6fac.png\"/></div><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">探索条目</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">花开富贵</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">落花盖住了青砖，想必这趟行仪是一路顺遂。</span></span></span></p><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">探索目标</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">到达第四层【汝吾门】</span></span></span></p><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">探索条件</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">初始持有收藏品吉运有三、酿山河</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">初始携带的通宝附带品相易花（不包括来自分队的通宝）</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">掉落的钱币附带品相易花</span></span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"209\" alt=\"厉兵秣驮.png\" title=\"厉兵秣驮.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20260113/06d95469a72cf52dc5016138824866b8.png\"/></div><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">探索条目</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">厉兵秣驮</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">厉风吹倒了门扉，想必这趟行仪是凶险万分。</span></span></span></p><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">探索目标</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">到达第四层【汝吾门】</span></span></span></p><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">探索条件</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">初始持有收藏品异食兽像、旧烽遗梦、铿金征鼓</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">初始携带的通宝附带品相易厉（不包括来自分队的通宝）</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">掉落的钱币附带品相易厉</span></span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"210\" alt=\"地生五霸.png\" title=\"地生五霸.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20260113/8c6f4079416252297675ecfe53466b2e.png\"/></div><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">探索条目</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">地生五霸</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">在“买通”小八界后，鸭爵开始环游界园，寻求新的投资项目。</span></span></span></p><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">探索目标</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">击败流泪小子或鸭爵或高普尼克或圆仔或小八界，至少4次</span></span></span></p><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">探索条件</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">初始钱盒额外携带通宝鸭爵金币，并附带品相特殊易变</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">鸭爵、高普尼克、流泪小子和圆仔的属性提升</span></span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"211\" alt=\"人隐晦明.png\" title=\"人隐晦明.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20260113/e36d91b4492a17421ce7036eeeec0705.png\"/></div><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">探索条目</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">人隐晦明</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">来人助我！</span></span></span></p><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">探索目标</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">到达第四层【汝吾门】</span></span></span></p><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">探索条件</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">初始钱盒额外携带通宝圣诏封神，并附带品相特殊易变</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">燃烛时，招募与进阶干员需要的希望提升</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">界园的结构已发生变化，请小心应对</span></span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"212\" alt=\"园外有天.png\" title=\"园外有天.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20260113/d2549b0cbe04bee421211521b85dc27f.png\"/></div><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">探索条目</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\